ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.fda.gov/cder/drug/early_comm/varenicline.htm"/></comment></citation></ref><ref id="b23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fenster</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>Rains</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Noerager</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Influence of subunit composition on desensitization of neuronal acetylcholine receptors at low concentrations of nicotine</article-title><source>J Neurosci</source><year>1997</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>5747</fpage><lpage>59</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9221773</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b24"><citation citation-type="web"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fiore</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name><name><surname>Bailey</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Treating tobacco use and dependence. Clinical Practice Guideline</article-title><year>2000</year><comment>[online]. Accessed 13 Feb 2007. URL: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.surgeongeneral.gov/tobacco/treating_tobacco_use.pdf"/></comment></citation></ref><ref id="b25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Foulds</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The neurobiological basis for partial agonist treatment of nicotine dependence: varenicline</article-title><source>Int J Clin Pract</source><year>2006</year><volume>60</volume><fpage>571</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16700857</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Foulds</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gandhi</surname><given-names>KK</gi